### 16.2 Configurations Types

#### PostgreSQL HA Configuration
```yaml
PostgreSQL_Cluster:
  nodes: 3 (1 primary, 2 replicas)
  replication: "Synchrone (quorum commit)"
  failover: "Patroni (automatique, < 30s)"
  backup:
    - "pgBackRest (incremental)"
    - "WAL archiving (continuous)"
  tuning:
    shared_buffers: "25% RAM"
    effective_cache_size: "75% RAM"
    max_connections: 500
    work_mem: "256MB"
```

